name hu-berlin-bundle
category Package
revision 57580
shortdesc LaTeX classes for the Humboldt-Universitat zu Berlin
longdesc This package provides files according to the corporate design
longdesc of the Humboldt-Universitat zu Berlin. This is not an official
longdesc package by the university itself, and not officially approved
longdesc by it. More information can be found in the Humboldt
longdesc University's corporate design guideline and on the website
longdesc https://www.hu-berlin.de/de/hu-intern/design. At present, the
longdesc bundle contains a letter class based on scrlttr2 and a package
longdesc hu-berlin-base.sty which contains all relevant code for
longdesc documents and documentclasses of the bundle.
